Package: shinobi-core
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Shinobi OS Maintainers <maintainers@shinobi-os.local>
Depends: systemd, dbus-user-session, python3, python3-yaml, python3-mcp, bash, coreutils, findutils, util-linux
Description: Shinobi OS desktop integration layer
 Native systemd user services, session environment integration, and
 idempotent configuration migrations for the Shinobi desktop.
 .
 Includes the recon MCP server, which the egress gate and every coding agent
 reach their tools through. python3-yaml is what the scope policy and the egress
 policy are parsed with, and it was not declared here before: the control plane
 shipped code that could not be imported on a host without it, and `shinobi
 egress check` was one import away from failing. python3-mcp is the recon
 server's own dependency -- it is not vendored, and the postinst verifies the
 import so a version that dropped mcp.server.fastmcp fails at install rather than
 at first use.
